@startuml
title MedNexus AI - Context Diagram (DFD Level 0)

left to right direction

rectangle "User" as User
rectangle "NCBI MeSH API" as MeSH
rectangle "PubMed API" as PubMed
rectangle "MedlinePlus API" as MedlinePlus
rectangle "Gemini API" as Gemini

usecase "MedNexus AI System" as System

User --> System : Search Queries\nLanguage Selection
System --> User : Medical Terms\nResearch Results\nHealth Information\nAI Explanations\nSource Links

System --> MeSH : Medical Term Query
MeSH --> System : Term Details\nSynonyms

System --> PubMed : Research Query
PubMed --> System : Publication Metadata\nAbstracts

System --> MedlinePlus : Health Topic Query
MedlinePlus --> System : Health Information

System --> Gemini : Retrieved Context\nExplanation Request
Gemini --> System : AI-Generated Explanation

@enduml
